# Which Daji system this build is for, and where it lives. Both are required: a build with neither (or with a mismatch) connects to nothing.
#   dev  = your own computer or a private network address (http is allowed there)
#   test = a rehearsal server with its own database and Razorpay TEST keys (https only; it can never be the live host)
#   live = the real system (only https://api.dajicricket.com)
EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=dev
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:4000
